clypse (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New COSMIC panel applet (clypse-applet) built with libcosmic
  * App ID renamed to io.github.felipe_abreu.Clypse (Flathub-verifiable)
  * Metainfo: fixed URLs, added screenshots and vcs-browser
  * Daemon auto-start without systemd (Flatpak-friendly)
  * Flatpak manifest and packaging files added

 -- Felipe Abreu <fabreum.dev@gmail.com>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 23:00:00 -0300

clypse (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete rewrite in Rust (from Python/PyQt6 prototype)
  * GTK4 + libadwaita native UI
  * Wayland zwlr-data-control-v1 event-driven clipboard monitoring
  * SQLite WAL + FTS5 full-text search history
  * systemd user service with Type=notify watchdog
  * Favorites system with persistent protection from auto-eviction
  * Renamed project from Nebulip to Clypse

 -- Felipe Abreu <fabreum.dev@gmail.com>  Sat, 16 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
